note Four ne get G i v terms on a global in one or chain exhaust the register pool (error 12);
note three terms, a local array, or two bool locals combined with one or all compile.
global hdr uchar 16
fn main to int
if or or or ne get hdr 0 1 ne get hdr 1 2 ne get hdr 2 3 ne get hdr 3 4
ret 9
end
ret 0
end
